WEBVTT

00:00:28.121 --> 00:00:31.663
You know, the kind with shingles
and stained glass windows,

00:00:31.663 --> 00:00:33.454
a big wraparound porch.

00:00:34.162 --> 00:00:36.621
But it was kind of falling apart.

00:00:36.787 --> 00:00:41.037
Yes, sure. It was very drafty.
There was rot and wood.

00:00:41.037 --> 00:00:47.329
The porch was falling down. There was
stained glass that needed to be fixed.

00:00:47.829 --> 00:00:49.787
You know, this is my worst nightmare,
by the way.

00:00:49.871 --> 00:00:53.412
You know, but Michael's dad loved it.

00:00:53.912 --> 00:01:00.454
And slowly restoring this house piece by
piece became his ritual for years,